{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220210/extras/fe713044b886a46e11b6a4da2cca70e8.poster.avif?t=1743807709\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220210/extras/fe713044b886a46e11b6a4da2cca70e8.webm?t=1743807709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220210/extras/fe713044b886a46e11b6a4da2cca70e8.mp4?t=1743807709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slenderman: The Unknowns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you survive the forest, or will you become the next Slenderman?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a dark, eerie forest, your only way out is to find car parts hidden in abandoned locations. But time is running out. If you don\u2019t escape before midnight, you\u2019ll take Slenderman\u2019s place and be cursed to haunt the forest forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creepy forest filled with chilling surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thrill of searching for car parts while being hunted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A race against time to break the curse or become the hunted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifying atmosphere that keeps you on edge from start to finish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Break the Curse?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking. Will you find your way out and end the nightmare, or will you be trapped in the forest forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to face the horror and uncover the secrets of Slenderman: The Unknowns.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.